workspace/temp/

# Workspace directories for the Invisible Plagiarism Toolkit
# 
# input/original/   - Place your original DOCX documents here
# input/turnitin/   - Place your Turnitin PDF reports here
# output/processed/ - Final manipulated documents
# output/analysis/  - Analysis results and intermediate data
# output/reports/   - Comprehensive processing reports
# temp/            - Temporary files during processing
#
# Usage:
# 1. Copy your original document to input/original/
# 2. Copy your Turnitin report to input/turnitin/
# 3. Run: python main.py --mode balanced
# 4. Check results in output/processed/
